Crystal's Rock is a professional jewelers' conference held in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]], in a ballroom rented from a hotel. It is for people who work in the jewel trade or near it: dealers, stonecutters, and the suppliers of gems, with booths set around the room like a science fair grown into a small convention. Attendees come mostly from Calaria and [[Geography/Tormeré/index|Tormeré]], and a few from as far as [[Geography/Velthara/index|Velthara]].

Entry is limited to members of the Jewelers Union and the companies that sponsor them. A minotaur-looking man checks the door.
